      "created_at": "2016-06-21T03:44:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Deadline vs. Captain Cosmic, Mr. Fixer, Omnitron-U and Unity in the Dok'thorath Capital</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This is a pretty standard Deadline fight with no big surprises.&nbsp; An fun and easy Mint for me.&nbsp; I do wonder why the battle to protect humanity is happening on the Thorathian homeworld, but it's still a lot of fun :).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>There are some nice combos in thsi setup too, especially Omni-U playing Equipment for Unity to make bots (and get exrtra damage to boot).</p>",
