      "cooked": "<p>Mint. &nbsp;Good showcase of Captain Cosmic and Mr. Fixer being BFFs. &nbsp;Try to keep Fixer's stuff from being destroyed and you won't regret it. &nbsp;Dual Crowbars, Grease Monkey Fist, Harmony, Cosmic Weapon + Overdrive is a sight to behold.</p>",
