      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dandolo/{size}/1845_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-06-21T12:07:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint, ended the game with a fun finisher…<br>\nHasty augmentation on Mr. Fixer with his Crowbar, Monkey Fist, Harmony setup to hit Omnitron-U for 6 (destroying all components for 2 damage each) and then 9 to Deadline for the win.</p>\n<p>By the time I won all heroes were in single digits but the game felt fairly safe throughout regardless.</p>",
