      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/278dde/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-06-21T14:46:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>All heroes in single digits at the end, because I kept making mistakes (like accidentally hitting Mr. Fixer's Strike power instead of Cosmic Weapon...this happened multiple times and absentmindedly choosing to have Captain Cosmic shuffle his trash into his deck rather than discard&nbsp;from Ataxia Sphere...while he had Unflagging Animation out and several constructs in the trash)--things I would have used the rewind button for....</p>",
