      "raw": "[quote=\"Kratos13\"]\n\nMint.  Good showcase of Captain Cosmic and Mr. Fixer being BFFs.  Try to keep Fixer's stuff from being destroyed and you won't regret it.  Dual Crowbars, Grease Monkey Fist, Harmony, Cosmic Weapon + Overdrive is a sight to behold.\n\n[/quote]\n\nDefinitely BFFs. Don't neglect Augmented Ally and/or Dynamic Siphon so Fixer can use at least 2 powers each round!\nI didn't even get to use Overdrive.\nAll hero HP was in high teens except O-U... Fixer may have sliced him in the face with that Cosmic Weapon one time... with Hasty Augmentation...",
