      "created_at": "2016-06-22T04:44:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint. &nbsp;Definately a team of BFFs. &nbsp;Ended the game by bouncing a few Dual Crowbars off of constructs for 7-9 damage to Deadline's face, with Unity Hastily Augmenting two Defensive Blasts. &nbsp;Everyone was at low health by the end, but I could have easily dealt 12+ more damage in the last round, well set up, and Deadline had just nuked so I was in no serious danger.</p>",
