      "created_at": "2016-06-24T02:24:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint, with a lot of damage coming by way of either Unity or Deadline destroying O-U's stuff. No real trouble here -- leaving the looters out meant that the Rebel Base came out quickly, meaning the next set of rebels were on my side.</p><p>Unity didn't get much out, but got O-U to do a huge defensive blast -- and then Deadline offed himself by taking out that card.</p>",
